# Nothing this harness produces or consumes belongs in git.
#
# Benchmark corpora carry their own licences (LoCoMo is Snap Inc.'s, LongMemEval is its
# authors') and are never redistributed from this repository. Built memories and result
# files are outputs: they are reproducible from a run config and a corpus, and a
# committed result file is a number nobody can re-derive.

# Per-sample build cache (CacheConfig.dir default) and run outputs (RunConfig.output_dir).
.cache/
runs/

# Corpora, wherever an operator parks them.
data/
*locomo*.json
*longmemeval*.json

__pycache__/
# Fetched datasets and run outputs never enter git.
.pytest_cache/
.deepeval
cache/

# Forensic HTML views embed corpus text: local only (build with build_html_report.py).
reports/
